  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">2.</span> Mira esta tabla del <strong>frutero de Lucía</strong> y responde:</div>\n    <div class=\"e2-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"tabla-rellenar\">\n        <tr><th>Fruta</th><th>Cantidad</th></tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M 30 18 Q 16 18 16 34 Q 16 50 30 52 Q 44 50 44 34 Q 44 18 30 18 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg></td>\n          <td>6</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M 12 16 Q 10 38 18 50 Q 32 56 48 48 Q 50 46 50 42 Q 38 42 28 32 Q 18 22 18 14 Q 14 14 12 16 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></td>\n          <td>3</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M 30 14 Q 24 14 22 26 Q 14 34 16 44 Q 18 54 30 54 Q 42 54 44 44 Q 46 34 38 26 Q 36 14 30 14 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg></td>\n          <td>2</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n      <div class=\"preg-lista\">\n        <div class=\"preg-fila\">a) ¿Cuántas <strong>manzanas</strong> hay? <span class=\"preg-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"preg-fila\">b) ¿Cuántas <strong>peras</strong> hay? <span class=\"preg-hueco\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"preg-fila\">c) ¿De qué fruta hay <strong>MÁS</strong>? <span class=\"preg-hueco-grande\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"preg-fila\">d) ¿De qué fruta hay <strong>MENOS</strong>? <span class=\"preg-hueco-grande\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"preg-fila\">e) ¿Cuántas frutas hay <strong>EN TOTAL</strong>? <span class=\"preg-hueco\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
